司隸功曹從事。司空王朗辟為掾，袤舉高陽許允、扶風魯芝、東萊王基，朗皆命之，後咸至大位，有重名。袤遷尚書郎。出為黎陽令，吏民悅服。太守班下屬城，特見甄異，為諸縣之最。遷尚書右丞。轉濟陰太守，下車旌表孝悌，敬禮賢能，興立庠序，開誘後進。調補大將軍從事中郎，拜散騎常侍。會廣平太守缺，宣帝謂袤曰：「賢叔大匠垂稱于陽平、魏郡，百姓蒙惠化。且盧子家、王子雍繼踵此郡，使世不乏賢，故復相屈。」袤在廣平，以德化為先，善作條教，郡中愛之。徵拜侍中，百姓戀慕，涕泣路隅。遷少府。高貴鄉公即位，袤與河南尹王肅備法駕奉迎於元城，封廣昌亭侯。徙光祿勳，領宗正。","raw_start":540,"raw_end":838,"raw_line":13},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-zhengmao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015","text":"毌丘儉作亂，景帝自出征之，百官祖送於城東，袤疾病不任會。帝謂中領軍王肅曰：「唯不見鄭光祿為恨。」肅以語袤，袤自輿追帝，及於近道。帝笑曰：「故知侯生必來也。」遂與袤共載，曰：「計將何先？」袤曰：「昔與儉俱為台郎，特所知悉。其人好謀而不達事情，自昔建勳幽州，志望無限。文欽勇而無算。今大軍出其不意，江、淮之卒銳而不能固，深溝高壘以挫其氣，此亞夫之長也。」帝稱善。轉太常。高貴鄉公議立明堂辟雍，精選博士，袤舉劉毅、劉寔、程咸、庾峻，後並至公輔大位。及常道鄉公立，與議定策，進封安城鄉侯，邑千戶。景元初，疾病失明，屢乞骸骨，不許。拜光祿大夫。五等初建，封密陵伯。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"毌丘儉","kind":"person","person_id":"b61_784_cbb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAH","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"王肅","kind":"person","person_id":"j7j_veb_l8w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"鄭光祿","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0048","start":48,"end":49,"surface":"肅","kind":"person","person_id":"j7j_veb_l8w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0099","start":99,"end":100,"surface":"儉","kind":"person","person_id":"b61_784_cbb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"讀本段前後及對話，所指按此處記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"文欽","kind":"person","person_id":"d07_f6c_af4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0168","start":168,"end":170,"surface":"亞夫","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc_C","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0183","start":183,"end":187,"surface":"高貴鄉公","kind":"person","person_id":"d6b_ea7_928","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0199","start":199,"end":200,"surface":"袤","kind":"person","person_id":"ae4_588_bdb_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0201","start":201,"end":203,"surface":"劉毅","kind":"person","person_id":"fcn_avk_8w3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"劉寔","kind":"person","person_id":"ohv_l50_sf5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0207","start":207,"end":209,"surface":"程咸","kind":"person","person_id":"549_f84_359","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"庾峻","kind":"person","person_id":"524_294_dab","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao:line015:m0222","start":222,"end":226,"surface":"常道鄉公","kind":"person","person_id":"gke_14h_1xk_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":15,"last_line":15,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　毌丘儉作亂，景帝自出征之，百官祖送於城東，袤疾病不任會。帝謂中領軍王肅曰：「唯不見鄭光祿為恨。」肅以語袤，袤自輿追帝，及於近道。帝笑曰：「故知侯生必來也。」遂與袤共載，曰：「計將何先？」袤曰：「昔與儉俱為台郎，特所知悉。其人好謀而不達事情，自昔建勳幽州，志望無限。文欽勇而無算。今大軍出其不意，江、淮之卒銳而不能固，深溝高壘以挫其氣，此亞夫之長也。」帝稱善。轉太常。高貴鄉公議立明堂辟雍，精選博士，袤舉劉毅、劉寔、程咸、庾峻，後並至公輔大位。及常道鄉公立，與議定策，進封安城鄉侯，邑千戶。景元初，疾病失明，屢乞骸骨，不許。拜光祿大夫。五等初建，封密陵伯。","raw_start":840,"raw_end":1119,"raw_line":15},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-zhengmao","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-zhengmao"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:kaizi","text":"王愷字君夫，東海人，王肅子也。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:kaizi:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"王愷","kind":"person","person_id":"e09_16c_498","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:kaizi:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"君夫","kind":"person","person_id":"e09_16c_498","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early:kaizi:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"王肅","kind":"person","person_id":"j7j_veb_l8w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note","source_quote":{"witness":"ss30","quote":"王愷字君夫，東海人，王肅子也。","raw_start":739,"raw_end":754,"raw_line":12,"source_layer":"劉注引晉諸公贊"},"attribution":{"annotator":"劉孝標","quoted_work":"晉諸公贊"},"chapter_id":"c-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early","book_id":"b-shishuoxinyu-030","work_id":"w-shishuoxinyu","source_id":"s-shishuoxinyu-030-jin098-dun-early"},{"id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p003","text":"高祖受命，拜黃門侍郎。永初二年，奏曰：「鄭玄注禮，三年之喪，二十七月而吉，古今學者多謂得禮之宜。晉初用王肅議，祥禫共月，故二十五月而除，遂以為制。江左以來，唯晉朝施用；縉紳之士，多遵玄義。夫先王制禮，以大順羣心。喪也寧戚，著自前訓。今大宋開泰，品物遂理。愚謂宜同即物情，以玄義為制，朝野一禮，則家無殊俗。」從之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":20,"end":22,"surface":"鄭玄","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p003:m0020","person_id":"95f_p0e_7s8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作鄭。"},{"start":37,"end":41,"surface":"古今學者","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p003:u0037","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"泛指歷代論禮者"},{"start":51,"end":53,"surface":"王肅","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p003:m0051","person_id":"j7j_veb_l8w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作肅。"},{"start":84,"end":88,"surface":"縉紳之士","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p003:u0084","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"士大夫總稱"},{"start":91,"end":92,"surface":"玄","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p003:m0091","person_id":"95f_p0e_7s8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作鄭。"},{"start":95,"end":97,"surface":"先王","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p003:u0095","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"制禮者泛稱"},{"start":136,"end":137,"surface":"玄","id":"c-songshu-060-wangzhunzhi:p003:m0136","person_id":"95f_p0e_7s8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作鄭。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":77,"last_line":77,"revision_id":1996694,"source_layer"